{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0334_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "9b812b8788db42b8bf2ae657136fc6e99ad5d1c50303427974801228d02f923e", "ja": "ホント？　エヘヘ、やったー♪\nこの服、ワタシが選んだんだヨ！　すごいでしょ！", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，太好了♪  \n这件衣服是我自己选的哦！很厉害吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0334_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "18d094177d37870a39ad03d9897e3e6351433ddcedaefc3aebea415e1ca4ca23", "ja": "ママンやお店の人に、いっぱい相談して……\n「コレ！」って思える服を見つけたノ！", "zh": "我还向妈妈和店员们请教了好多……  \n终于找到了让我觉得“就是这件！”的衣服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0334_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "4ea7306ec01ebcd7f57e090281574c235b3344178b379e8fc9a5ff3df49cf199", "ja": "いろんなお店で試着するのは、ちょっと疲れたケド……\nでも、悩みながらお買い物するの楽しかったヨ！", "zh": "在各种店里试穿衣服，稍微有点累，不过……\n一边纠结一边买东西，还是很开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
